      "content": "Your desire to keep control over your identity is valid, yet your fear of losing your selfhood may be holding you still from the help you actually need right now. Sometimes, what looks like a slow decline is simply a moment of fog that clears once you find the right support to guide you back to where you are safe. You are not required to watch yourself vanish; reaching out doesn't mean giving up your dignity, but rather choosing to be understood without losing yourself.",
