    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just fog. it's like a thief. it's taking my memories, my personality, my ability to even hold a conversation. if i wait, i'm just going to be a burden to everyone i love. i'll be a ghost trapped in a body that doesn't work anymore. wouldn't it be more merciful to just... end it now, while i can still say goodbye properly? while i'm still actually me?",
